      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "consider 是常考单词，所以学生一定要掌握其用法："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "consider 后面跟疑问代词 + 不定式。例如："
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "I am "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "considering"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " what to do after supper. 我正在考虑吃过晚饭做什么。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "consider 后面跟动名词，例如："
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Have you considered hiring a car? 你考虑过租辆车吗？"
        }
      ]
    }
